%% MUPP-044 Secret Santa: yearly cleanup
%% Vercel Cron calls the route once a day; the cleanup runs once a year.
flowchart TD
    A[Vercel Cron, daily] --> B{Right CRON_SECRET?}
    B -- no --> C[401, nothing happens]
    B -- yes --> D{24 January or later, and not cleaned this year? R1}
    D -- no --> E[Nothing changes]
    D -- yes --> F[Per event, one transaction: delete wishes, set inactive R1]
    F --> G[Save the year in ss_cleanup]
    G --> H[Cookies with the old year are refused R4]
    F -.-> I[Log ss_draw, events and members stay R2]
    H --> J[Administrator activates and starts, draw reads the log R3]
